[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0010","text":"雏菜\n得买伴手礼～～\n（注：雏菜口癖，句尾常带长音）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0020","text":"啊，我也是……！\n被人拜托买吉祥物回去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0030","text":"透和圆香呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0040","text":"嗯／嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0050","text":"好像没被拜托什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0060","text":"没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0070","text":"这、这样啊……\n那我们很快就回来，你们等一下……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0080","text":"……这边，那个不就行了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0090","text":"贝比卡斯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_04_0100","text":"耶——"}]
